### ========================================
### PRUEBAS DE SEGURIDAD
### ========================================

### 1. Register sin password (Error 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "rol_id": 1
}

### 2. Register con rol inválido (Error 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rol_id": 99
}

### 3. Login con credenciales incorrectas (Error 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user1@example.com",
  "password": "ContrasenaIncorrecta"
}

### 4. Rate limit en /auth/login (6 intentos fallidos)
# Ejecuta estas 6 peticiones secuencialmente.
# Esperado: 401 en los primeros 5 y 429 en el 6to.

### RL1 - intento fallido 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass1!"
}

### RL2 - intento fallido 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass2!"
}

### RL3 - intento fallido 3
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass3!"
}

### RL4 - intento fallido 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass4!"
}

### RL5 - intento fallido 5
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass5!"
}

### RL6 - intento fallido 6 (debe devolver 429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPass6!"
}

### 5. Login administrador (obtener token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Login empleado (obtener token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "empleado_prueba@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 7. Acceso con token mal formado (Error 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer malformed.token.value
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 8. Crear usuario sin token (Error 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user-sin-token@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rol_id": 2
}

### 9. Crear usuario con token de empleado (Error 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{empleadoToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "empleado2@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "rol_id": 2
}

### 10. Listar usuarios como administrador (debe funcionar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. Refresh token revocado o inválido (Error 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "token-invalido"
}

### 12. SQL Injection en login (debe devolver 401/400, no autenticar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "adm@example.com' OR '1'='1",
  "password": "anything"
}
